'' RUN: a SELECT CASE over a narrow subject compares a WIDER case value in the promoted
'' type. Narrowing it to the subject's width was taken to be harmless when the two have
'' the same signedness: over 'dim as short s = -2', 'case 65534' became -2 and matched.
'' Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/select-narrow-case.bas -o tests/codegen/selectnarrowcase.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/selectnarrowcase.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: a nomatch
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: b nomatch
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: c lt
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: d out
